tps://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312373_1363239738226092_2106854729412937022_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KqHHilxzQMAQ7kNvwGKcHYE&_nc_oc=AdonSBfG7T9MVFhjJK7kVMfL6dp_Eo4772NwJ00ordnfJQXqbkA7eTkaofMhA0E9Jq8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAkkV51_1HCrv7hkPkYDAODRiTvF5vje2-LD9jK16smYg&oe=6A5B6E6E"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image_02.png", "id": "1188201992987967", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295509_1188201996321300_2111120103698102006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-g7KBLWwjVAQ7kNvwGeOagg&_nc_oc=Adr8gIkIdAY7kpONaEh7B4uT9Nt4d6q9tyuPTUjNlAgAsRb9TgPgalKLSNMmUmpR17U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCsjDZQNbXeDch0AteSQrSn5QpSJO28QS5HNE5WwWlz4g&oe=6A5B62CA"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image_02.png", "id": "1737987487068873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295801_1737987493735539_1039395962667216685_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XpkWjJCexCUQ7kNvwEhG5C0&_nc_oc=Adqr-aEanS-s6nU6SXmKC0QtN45Va2dQ0MuUI3Zg4ta8OMgW2xMflPataCWwwyp1Tpo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDWTcTZD1TOsXvdNboI2HF7UKUgz7nxAHy2vKZqzP5q6w&oe=6A5B8A2B"}, {"file_name": "DodgeLasers_02.png", "id": "3637904013182167", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294007_3637904023182166_4032639804070807573_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7B617feM5IcQ7kNvwFtgCFU&_nc_oc=AdpsL1_dtxY266PlhJFJY6AOKp5iLX19sztERNcSO_FpzVC3heZUdQI-6W9ry325usQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAInoqdfN2NC-bQXl8F5_UXcZMun8AszTWZP1N_6nnp1Q&oe=6A5B7731"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_New.png", "id": "898823102474350", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_898823109141016_4587002048357409884_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wYABQNJmUSoQ7kNvwHoPPkE&_nc_oc=AdokzGv4lRapocwCWsi8FPwinBPP86QA4Ed77zQqx-L6IZ62e4plVi5gu8udMTap1Aw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAh8e8QkzZiAYrhRxWIJo3PGLiqc99_EvGwsA7V4zf0bg&oe=6A5B76F8"}, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Punch Bomb\nis a fast-paced 360\u00b0 action arcade game where you punch bombs away before they explode.\n\nBuilt for those who love a challenge.\n\nClimb the global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Classic Mode\nSurvive as long as you can! Punch a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, dodge dangerous laser obstacles, hit targets, and rack up huge combos.\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRace against the clock to get a high score within the time limit! Bombs no longer explode, and targets extend your time. \n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock unique cosmetics by **playing the game** and mastering its challenges. Each cosmetic has its own visual flair!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Punch bombs away from you before they explode while racking up combos, dodging dangerous laser obstacles, and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priv